# Closed Hamiltonian cycle on the 16^3 cubic lattice, from ndmansfield's
# -record-loops mode (see README). Every edge is a unit step, so the projection
# is degenerate everywhere: whole columns of vertices project onto each other,
# many edges project to points, and long runs of edges are collinear.
note = space-filling lattice knot; all degeneracy classes at once
vertical_edges       >= 1
coincident_vertices  >= 1
vertex_on_edge       >= 1
corner_corner        >= 1
collinear_overlap    >= 1
multiple_points      >= 1
max_point_multiplicity >= 3
spatial              == 0
